/- English proof (translation)
Establish `hr` using `C.hr`. Establish `hbm : b < T.rank` using `by omega`. Rewrite using `[varF, dif_pos ⟨hbm, ha⟩, phi, AlgHom.comp_apply, MvPolynomial.rename_X, Ctx.toH, MvPolynomial.aeval_X]`. Use `congr 2`. Use `Prod.ext rfl (Prod.ext ?_ rfl)` and prove the remaining obligations.

Simplify using `only`. Rewrite using `[Equiv.symm_apply_eq]`. Apply `Fin.ext` to reduce the goal to its premises. Rewrite using `[rowIdx_inr]`. Simplify using `only [revPos]`.

Rewrite using `[dif_pos ⟨hb, by omega⟩]`.
